      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:8:1:33:12",
      "text": [
        " دَخَلَ يَحْيَى بْنُ سَابُورَ عَلَى أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ (عليه السلام) لِيُوَدِّعَهُ فَقَالَ لَهُ أَبُو عَبْدِ اللَّهِ (عليه السلام) أَمَا وَ اللَّهِ إِنَّكُمْ لَعَلَى الْحَقِّ وَ إِنَّ مَنْ خَالَفَكُمْ لَعَلَى غَيْرِ الْحَقِّ وَ اللَّهِ مَا أَشُكُّ لَكُمْ فِي الْجَنَّةِ وَ إِنِّي لَأَرْجُو أَنْ يُقِرَّ اللَّهُ لِأَعْيُنِكُمْ عَنْ قَرِيبٍ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473237\">H 14567</a> – Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Muhammad Bin Khalid and Al-Husayn Bin Saeed altogether, from Al-Nazar Bin Suweyd, from Yahya Bin Umraan Al-Halby, from Abdullah Bin Muskaan, from Badr Bin Al-Waleed Al-Khash’amy who said:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-y\">Y</span>ahya Bin Sabour came</span> up to Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> to say farewell to him<sup>asws</sup>. So Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> said to him: ‘By Allah<sup>azwj</sup>! You are upon the ‘الْحَقِّ’ Just, and that the ones opposed to you are upon other than the Just. By Allah<sup>azwj</sup>! I<sup>asws</sup> have no doubt for you with regards to the Paradise, and I<sup>asws</sup> hope that Allah<sup>azwj</sup> would Delight your eyes very soon’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "119. Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Muhammad Bin Khalid and Al-Husayn Bin Saeed altogether, from Al-Nazar Bin Suweyd, from Yahya Bin Umraan Al-Halby, from Abdullah Bin Muskaan, from Badr Bin Al-Waleed Al-Khash’amy who said: Yahya Bin Sabour came up to Abu Abdullah (a.s.) to say farewell to him (a.s.). So Abu Abdullah (a.s.) said to him: ‘By Allah (azwj)! You are upon the ‘الْحَقِّ’ Just, and that the ones opposed to you are upon other than the Just. By Allah (azwj)! I (a.s.) have no doubt for you with regards to the Paradise, and I (a.s.) hope that Allah (azwj) would Delight your eyes very soon’."
        ]
      }
